{
 "source": "trapp",
 "book": "2CH",
 "chapter": 1,
 "units": [
  {
   "id": "trapp/2CH.1.1",
   "range": "2CH.1.1",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "c4b05041",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "trapp/2CH.1.1#p1-c4b05041",
     "text": "Defying the opposition of Adonijah and his accomplices. See 1Ki 1:4-10.",
     "anchor": "And Solomon the son of David was strengthened in his kingdom.",
     "refs": [
      {
       "text": "1Ki 1:4-10",
       "ref": "1KI.1.4-10"
      }
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "trapp/2CH.1.2",
   "range": "2CH.1.2",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "bb020cfd",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "trapp/2CH.1.2#p1-bb020cfd",
     "text": "As David had done before him. {1Ch 28:1; 1Ch 29:1}",
     "anchor": "Then Solomon spake unto all Israel.",
     "refs": [
      {
       "text": "1Ch 28:1",
       "ref": "1CH.28.1"
      },
      {
       "text": "1Ch 29:1",
       "ref": "1CH.29.1"
      }
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "trapp/2CH.1.3",
   "range": "2CH.1.3",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "b0fc47d0",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "trapp/2CH.1.3#p1-51beaa27",
     "text": "This word is usually taken in an ill sense: but here in a good. {a} See on 1Ki 3:4.",
     "anchor": "Went to the high place.",
     "refs": [
      {
       "text": "1Ki 3:4",
       "ref": "1KI.3.4"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "trapp/2CH.1.3#p2-34e6c8e7",
     "text": "{a} Vatab."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "trapp/2CH.1.4",
   "range": "2CH.1.4",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "4b524306",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "trapp/2CH.1.4#p1-4b524306",
     "text": "See on 2Sa 6:2, &c.",
     "anchor": "But the ark.",
     "refs": [
      {
       "text": "2Sa 6:2",
       "ref": "2SA.6.2"
      }
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "trapp/2CH.1.5",
   "range": "2CH.1.5",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "9d5abaa6",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "trapp/2CH.1.5#p1-696c42d8",
     "text": "i.e., Moses put.",
     "anchor": "He put"
    },
    {
     "id": "trapp/2CH.1.5#p2-84cb976c",
     "text": "Or, Unto him, i.e., the Lord; there they did their devotions to him: they diligently sought him, as the word signitieth. Compare Heb 11:6.",
     "anchor": "And Solomon and all the congregation sought unto it.",
     "refs": [
      {
       "text": "Heb 11:6",
       "ref": "HEB.11.6"
      }
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "trapp/2CH.1.6",
   "range": "2CH.1.6",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "0c6150bc",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "trapp/2CH.1.6#p1-0c6150bc",
     "text": "Which was so called, because there the people met to serve God.",
     "anchor": "The tabernacle of the congregation."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "trapp/2CH.1.7",
   "range": "2CH.1.7",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "d538ac8f",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "trapp/2CH.1.7#p1-c630acc7",
     "text": "See on 1Ki 3:5.",
     "anchor": "In that night.",
     "refs": [
      {
       "text": "1Ki 3:5",
       "ref": "1KI.3.5"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "trapp/2CH.1.7#p2-8e3c722c",
     "text": "That this was a divine dream, Solomon was sufficiently sensible, by the great wisdom wherewith he found himself indued when he awoke.",
     "anchor": "Did God appear."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "trapp/2CH.1.8",
   "range": "2CH.1.8",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "aa5d0864",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "trapp/2CH.1.8#p1-aa5d0864",
     "text": "God must be praised for the kindness he hath showed to our ancestors also. See on 1Ki 3:6.",
     "anchor": "Thou hast showed, &c.",
     "refs": [
      {
       "text": "1Ki 3:6",
       "ref": "1KI.3.6"
      }
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "trapp/2CH.1.9",
   "range": "2CH.1.9",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "e6a4fe68",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "trapp/2CH.1.9#p1-e6a4fe68",
     "text": "viz., To the utmost extent of it.",
     "anchor": "Let thy promise"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "trapp/2CH.1.10",
   "range": "2CH.1.10",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "1678e0be",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "trapp/2CH.1.10#p1-1fb700c4",
     "text": "Knowledge to discern, and wisdom to do that which is right.",
     "anchor": "Give me now wisdom and knowledge."
    },
    {
     "id": "trapp/2CH.1.10#p2-c62a2cc7",
     "text": "See on 1Ki 3:7.",
     "anchor": "That I may go out, &c.",
     "refs": [
      {
       "text": "1Ki 3:7",
       "ref": "1KI.3.7"
      }
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "trapp/2CH.1.11",
   "range": "2CH.1.11",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "5e304af1",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "trapp/2CH.1.11#p1-5e304af1",
     "text": "See 1Ki 3:11.",
     "anchor": "Thou hast not asked riches.",
     "refs": [
      {
       "text": "1Ki 3:11",
       "ref": "1KI.3.11"
      }
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "trapp/2CH.1.12",
   "range": "2CH.1.12",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "2d2f377a",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "trapp/2CH.1.12#p1-2d2f377a",
     "text": "See here how highly therefore we are to esteem Solomen’s writings. Well might he say, \"Have not I written to thee excellent things in counsels and knowledge?\" {Pro 22:20}",
     "anchor": "Wisdom and knowledge is granted.",
     "refs": [
      {
       "text": "Pro 22:20",
       "ref": "PRO.22.20"
      }
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "trapp/2CH.1.13",
   "range": "2CH.1.13",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "6dfad66b",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "trapp/2CH.1.13#p1-6dfad66b",
     "text": "Sic regnabat, he so reigned, sc., with that wisdom and knowledge which God had promised him.",
     "anchor": "And reigned over Israel."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "trapp/2CH.1.14",
   "range": "2CH.1.14",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "2062b417",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "trapp/2CH.1.14#p1-2062b417",
     "text": "This is here added to show how God made good to Solomon that other part of his promise also concerning riches and honours. And here the lawgiver might dispense with that law of his, {Deu 17:16} by a singular privilege to this king of Israel. See on 1Ki 4:26.",
     "anchor": "And Solomon gathered chariots and horsemen.",
     "refs": [
      {
       "text": "Deu 17:16",
       "ref": "DEU.17.16"
      },
      {
       "text": "1Ki 4:26",
       "ref": "1KI.4.26"
      }
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "trapp/2CH.1.15",
   "range": "2CH.1.15",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "4cf061b7",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "trapp/2CH.1.15#p1-4cf061b7",
     "text": "Heb., Gave. By giving he made it so. This was a golden age indeed.",
     "anchor": "And the king made."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "trapp/2CH.1.17",
   "range": "2CH.1.17",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "bd95860f",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "trapp/2CH.1.17#p1-bd95860f",
     "text": "See 1Ki 10:28-29.",
     "anchor": "And Solomon had horses, &c.",
     "refs": [
      {
       "text": "1Ki 10:28-29",
       "ref": "1KI.10.28-29"
      }
     ]
    }
   ]
  }
 ]
}
